{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18612","headline":"商山临路有孤松往来斫以爲明好事者怜之编竹成楥遂其生植感而赋诗 · 柳宗元","name":"商山临路有孤松往来斫以爲明好事者怜之编竹成楥遂其生植感而赋诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孤松停翠盖，托根临广路。\n不以险自防，遂爲明所误。\n幸逢仁惠意，重此藩篱护。\n犹有半心存，时将承雨露。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18612.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18612","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}